# A .stow-local-ignore replaces stow's built-in ignore list for this package
# rather than adding to it, so the defaults worth keeping are repeated here.
\.DS_Store
.+~
\#.*\#

# App-managed state, not configuration. Claude Desktop rewrites this file on its
# own schedule: paired-device and account UUIDs, pane/workspace state, and MCP
# servers pointing at local work paths. This repo is PUBLIC, so symlinking the
# live file into it would publish all of that the next time the app saved. The
# tracked copy stays a reference snapshot of the MCP server list; the live file
# is left alone as a real file.
^/?Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config\.json$
